.TH server "2022-11-27" "1.0" "server man page"
.SH NAME
server
.SH SYNOPSIS
server [PORT]
.SH ARGUMENTS
server arguments:
    PORT: port number between 5000 and 64000
.SH DESCRIPTION
server starts listening on port [port] for clients.
server recieves Tn from a client and performs a transaction with n cpu cycles.
server can have a maximum of 32 clients with 16 in backlog.
server times out after 30 seconds of inactivity.
server will log activity to a file named server.log
.SH SEE ALSO
client
